import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 831 | Transcended Ones and the Future · Overview — The Transcended One's Future Vision","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 831 | Transcended Ones and the Future · Overview — The Transcended One's Future Vision","no":831,"module":4,"tags":["Transcended One","Future","Future Vision","Overview","Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm"],"related":["00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmos Overview","11-Deduction-Iteration System Detailed","09-Reality-as-Base Fundamental Stance"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0831_模块4-超脱者与未来-总论.md","filePath":"en/0831_模块4-超脱者与未来-总论.md"}`),a={name:"en/0831_模块4-超脱者与未来-总论.md"};function s(r,e,d,u,l,h){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-831-transcended-ones-and-the-future-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-future-vision" tabindex="-1">Entry 831 | Transcended Ones and the Future · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Future Vision <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-831-transcended-ones-and-the-future-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-future-vision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 831 | Transcended Ones and the Future · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Future Vision&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 00, 11, 09</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-transcended-one-is-not-a-gardener-living-in-the-present-but-a-navigator-seeing-the-distance" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the transcended one is not a gardener living in the present, but a navigator seeing the distance <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-transcended-one-is-not-a-gardener-living-in-the-present-but-a-navigator-seeing-the-distance" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the transcended one is not a gardener living in the present, but a navigator seeing the distance&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Previous entries described the transcended one&#39;s daily work in six dimensions: energy, consciousness, laws, planes, cosmos, and civilization. But the transcended one is not only a &quot;head-down worker&quot; — he must also look up at the road. <strong>Future vision is the transcended one&#39;s looking up at the road.</strong> Strong ones in the old system mostly live in the present: solve present enemies, break through present bottlenecks, enjoy present victories. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended one is different — his existence scale is measured in ten-thousands of years; he must see far enough to ensure every step of current work heads in the right direction.</p><p>Six top-level axioms as overall vision are again run through in this entry: the anti-predation axiom requires future planning not point to a predatory future; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the future be Myriad Ranks&#39; common future; the collective ascension axiom requires the future direction be continuous uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires planning for the future not become pre-interference in others&#39; causality; the law-first axiom requires future vision be built on law self-consistency, not fantasize about a future violating physics.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This article, as the &quot;Transcended Ones and the Future&quot; sub-series overview, sorts out what the transcended one&#39;s future vision is, how it is built, and how it is used.</p><h2 id="i-future-vision-s-three-time-scales" tabindex="-1">I. Future Vision&#39;s Three Time Scales <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-future-vision-s-three-time-scales" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Future Vision&#39;s Three Time Scales&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s future vision is not a vague &quot;long-term plan,&quot; but precise planning at three time scales:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Time Scale</th><th>Planning Scope</th><th>Planning Content</th><th>Planning-Update Frequency</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Near-term vision</td><td>100–1000 standard cycles</td><td>Concrete engineering advancement at the current civilizational stage</td><td>Updated every standard cycle</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-term vision</td><td>1000–10000 standard cycles</td><td>The overall roadmap for the cosmic-uplift stage</td><td>Updated every thousand cycles</td></tr><tr><td>Long-term vision</td><td>Ten-thousand-plus cycles</td><td>The ultimate direction of multiverse civilization</td><td>Reviewed every ten-thousand cycles</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Three scales&#39; planning is not split — near-term planning obeys the mid-term roadmap; the mid-term roadmap obeys the long-term direction. The transcended one&#39;s daily work (near-term) must all be tested within the mid-term roadmap and long-term direction framework: doing this thing, is it pushing the mid-term roadmap forward, or deviating from the long-term direction?</p><h2 id="ii-future-vision-s-tools-the-deduction-iteration-system-and-quest-domain-simulation" tabindex="-1">II. Future Vision&#39;s Tools: The Deduction-Iteration System and Quest-Domain Simulation <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-future-vision-s-tools-the-deduction-iteration-system-and-quest-domain-simulation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Future Vision&#39;s Tools: The Deduction-Iteration System and Quest-Domain Simulation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one does not look forward to the future by intuition — he has precise tools. The <strong>Deduction-Iteration System</strong> (Document 11) and <strong>Quest Sediment Domain simulation-review</strong> are his two core tools:</p><ul><li><strong>Deduction-Iteration System</strong>: the transcended one inputs the current cosmic state into a deduction model, simulating development trends under different future paths — take Path A, how will the cosmos be after 1000 cycles? Take Path B? Deduction results provide data support for planning.</li><li><strong>Quest Sediment Domain simulation-review</strong>: for major future decisions, conduct full-dimensional simulation in the Quest Sediment Domain — simulate the decision&#39;s impact under different scenarios, identify risks, validate plans.</li></ul><p>Two tools ensure: <strong>the transcended one&#39;s future vision is not fantasy, but data-supported deduction.</strong> He does not &quot;believe&quot; what the future will be; he &quot;deduces&quot; what the future may be, then plans based on deduction results.</p><h2 id="iii-future-vision-s-boundaries-cannot-see-everything-cannot-control-everything" tabindex="-1">III. Future Vision&#39;s Boundaries: Cannot See Everything, Cannot Control Everything <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-future-vision-s-boundaries-cannot-see-everything-cannot-control-everything" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Future Vision&#39;s Boundaries: Cannot See Everything, Cannot Control Everything&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s future vision has clear boundaries:</p><ul><li><strong>Cannot precisely foresee individual fate</strong>: future vision looks at macro trends — the cosmos&#39; energy direction, civilization&#39;s development stage, uplift rhythm. It does not predict what some concrete cultivator will do tomorrow. Individual fate is decided by the individual&#39;s own choices.</li><li><strong>Cannot control the future&#39;s direction</strong>: seeing future trends does not mean one may forcibly control them. The future is the result of Myriad Ranks&#39; joint choices — the transcended one provides information and guidance, but does not choose for Myriad Ranks.</li><li><strong>The future will change</strong>: deduction results are based on the current state, which is constantly changing. The transcended one&#39;s future vision must also continuously update — may not use a deduction result from a thousand years ago to make today&#39;s decisions.</li></ul><p>Three boundaries ensure: future vision is &quot;navigation,&quot; not &quot;script.&quot; It tells direction, but does not write the ending.</p><h2 id="iv-why-the-transcended-one-must-have-future-vision" tabindex="-1">IV. Why the Transcended One Must Have Future Vision <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-why-the-transcended-one-must-have-future-vision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Why the Transcended One Must Have Future Vision&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Why does the transcended one need to see so far? The reason is very practical: <strong>his work cycle is too long.</strong></p><p>An ordinary cultivator&#39;s life is measured in centuries; planning the next few decades is enough for him. But the transcended one&#39;s existence is measured in ten-thousands of years — the cause he plants today may not bear fruit until ten-thousand years later. If he only sees the present, he may make a decision favorable short-term but harmful long-term.</p><p>For example: relax energy-cycle standards today; short-term all cultivators are happy — but ten-thousand years later, declining energy purity causes the law network to degrade; Myriad Ranks&#39; cultivation foundation is eroded. Short-term benefit, long-term disaster. Future vision is the defense line against such &quot;short-sighted decisions&quot; — when the transcended one makes every decision, he must ask: looking back on this decision ten-thousand years later, is it right?</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: future vision ensures decision direction is correct, avoiding the huge waste caused by &quot;short-term favorable long-term harmful&quot; decisions</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: future vision&#39;s deduction identifies which seemingly favorable paths actually head toward predation, avoiding them in advance</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo protagonists take one step and look one step, often pushed by plot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended ones plan the future on the ten-thousand-year scale, direction clear</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: future vision&#39;s planning faces Myriad Ranks&#39; common future, not favoring some race or group</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: three time scales, two deduction tools, and three vision boundaries are all publicly queryable; Myriad Ranks may understand future planning&#39;s direction</p></li><li><p>Terminology alignment: the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight dynamically adjusts with post performance; Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision monitors operation compliance throughout; the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle ensures energy and knowledge circulate perpetually among Myriad Ranks; exercise of law-anchor authority is strictly constrained by four-dimensional assessment and democratic procedure.</p></li><li><p><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s future vision is his ability to &quot;look up at the road.&quot; He does not only work head-down; he sees far enough — near-looking at hundred-cycle projects, mid-looking at thousand-cycle roadmaps, far-looking at ten-thousand-cycle direction. He uses deduction and simulation instead of intuition, uses data and planning instead of fantasy. His vision has boundaries: does not foresee individual fate, does not control the future&#39;s direction, does not use old deductions for new decisions. But precisely because this vision exists, his daily work has direction — not spinning in place, but steadily advancing on Myriad Ranks&#39; common future direction. This is &quot;future vision&quot; at the hyper-multiverse realm&#39;s orthodox definition: not seeing the future then controlling it, but seeing the distance then leading Myriad Ranks to walk over together.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/00-衡元宙宇宙总览.html">Entry 00 · Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmos Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/11-推演迭代体系详解.html">Entry 11 · Deduction-Iteration System Detailed</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/09-现实为基根本立场.html">Entry 09 · Reality-as-Base Fundamental Stance</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/825_模块4-超脱者与宇宙-衡锚超多元境宇宙级运作.html">Entry 825 · The Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s Cosmic-Grade Operation</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const g=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
